␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀# /rom/lib/profile: what each shell runs as it starts (rc -l: after newns), before its first prompt.  $window is
# its window (init's, wstart's): its console goes at /dev, and its notes (Ctrl-C) to the shell's note group.

prompt=('% ' '	')
if(~ $#window 0) window=0
if(! ~ $window 0){
	unmount '#c' /dev
	bind -a '#c'^$window /dev
